				"看来含有外星科技的陨石偏离了地球，反而击中了水星！"
				""
				"要开始设置你的高级存储系统，就前往太阳系中第二颗最热的行星吧！"
				""
				"Applied Energistics 2 能做很多事情，但主要功能是数字存储、自动合成和无线存储访问。"
				""
				"{\"text\":\"For more information about the mod that is outside the scope of these quests, consult the in game guide or\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\" online wiki.\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"open_url\",\"value\":\"https://guide.appliedenergistics.org/1.20.1/\"},\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true}]}"
